  "notes": "{下落|げらく} is a formal term specifically for downward movement in prices and values.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {株価|かぶか}の{下落|げらく} (drop in stock prices)\n- {地価|ちか}の{下落|げらく} (decline in land prices)\n- {大幅|おおはば}に{下落|げらく}する (decline sharply)\n- {下落|げらく}{傾向|けいこう} (downward trend)\n- {下落|げらく}{幅|はば} (extent of the decline)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {下落|げらく}: decline in price/value (formal, financial)\n- {低下|ていか}: decline in level or quality (broader usage)\n- {下|さ}がる: go down (everyday language)",
